record akr.evidence.discover-shape-accepted-by-rmcp3/1 : evidence {
    title "A real rmcp 3.1.2 client now connects to akr-mcp on both lifecycles. Before: the Auto (pre-initialize server/discover) path failed 'expect initialized result' because the discovery response was an initialize result under a discovery method name, and the post-initialize peer.discover() path failed 'Unexpected response type' - the error Codex 0.149 reported. After: Auto connects at 2026-07-28 and legacy+discover() connects at 2025-11-25, both listing 23 tools, with supportedVersions ['2026-07-28','2025-11-25','2025-06-18','2025-03-26','2024-11-05']. Adding 2025-11-25 also stops every rmcp 3.x host being silently answered 2024-11-05."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:30572b35946db07a711d0b88d0719483f9f3f6d9
    command "mcpprobe auto|post /home/dk/.local/bin/akr-mcp (rmcp 3.1.2 client, ClientLifecycleMode::Auto and Initialize+peer.discover())"
    summary """
        A real rmcp 3.1.2 client now connects to akr-mcp on both lifecycles. Before: the Auto (pre-initialize server/discover) path failed 'expect initialized result' because the discovery response was an initialize result under a discovery method name, and the post-initialize peer.discover() path failed 'Unexpected response type' - the error Codex 0.149 reported. After: Auto connects at 2026-07-28 and legacy+discover() connects at 2025-11-25, both listing 23 tools, with supportedVersions ['2026-07-28','2025-11-25','2025-06-18','2025-03-26','2024-11-05']. Adding 2025-11-25 also stops every rmcp 3.x host being silently answered 2024-11-05.
        """
}

